# PREDICTIONS (inferred), not results. Written 2026-11-28 before any run.
# Calibrates: section 7 rows "Format/modifier absent from dump" (both-reject) and
# "Format check skipped" (liftoff-only if the harness omits the FB modifier flag or the IN_FORMATS blob).
# Plane 10 lists AR24 linear only; plane 11 lists AR24 with modifier ...0001 only.
# Layer 2 is NV12 (format absent) or AR24 with modifier ...0002 (modifier absent): no plane takes it.
format-absent            structural=both-reject full=both-reject
modifier-absent          structural=both-reject full=both-reject
modifier-present-control structural=both-accept full=both-accept
